+- Runner: `TOTAL: PASS=15 FAIL=0`; 8 mutations each in its family; no floating-point literal or conversion; classical names only under Prior art, Imports and the parent's file citation.
+- Refuting pass (`CHECKER_block18_findings.md`): the group from two generators, the stabilizer classification from the rotation axes, the frame with a cube-group rotation and a second pair, and the orbit's radius by a symbolic angle — all consistent.
+- Claim type `bounded_theorem`; status `bounded-support`; trace `upstream_support`; audit required.
+
+## Not claimed
+Mixed-state domains; the Born form on frame-attached supports; supports with three or more recorded values in special position; any reading, menu, rule or coupling as physical.
